  "notifications_errorSnackBar_SignalingSessionMissed": "Erreur d'authentification, veuillez vous reconnecter",
  "@notifications_errorSnackBar_SignalingSessionMissed": {
    "description": "Shown in a notification or snackbar when the app's signaling session for the signed-in user is lost or rejected and re-authentication is required. Typical causes: expired or revoked access/refresh tokens, failed token refresh, authentication rejected by the core (e.g. SIP 401 Unauthorized), or the signaling server closing the session. Advise the user to sign in again to restore full functionality."
